data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-b-form","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_003b941f3001oYpmieOa01AFT6","role":"user","content":"请用 render_a2ui 渲染一个数据筛选表单 surface（surfaceId=v-form）：Column 根，含 TextField（品类关键词）、ChoicePicker（区域多选，options 华北/华东/华南）、CheckBox（包含退货单）、Slider（销售额阈值 0-50）、DateTimeInput（统计截止日期）、Button（应用筛选，primary，带 action）。数据用 data 模型 + {path} 绑定。"},{"id":"msg_003b94206001HzQxRLGLn55l2o-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render an A2UI data filter form surface with surfaceId=v-form. Let me check the workspace directory first to understand the data context.\n\nActually, the user is asking me to render a form using render_a2ui. Let me just do it. The data directory is workspace/threads/vision-b-form.\n\nLet me build the components:\n- Column root with children\n- TextField（品类关键词）\n- ChoicePicker（区域多选，options 华北/华东/华南）\n- CheckBox（包含退货单）\n- Slider（销售额阈值 0-50）\n- DateTimeInput（统计截止日期）\n- Button（应用筛选，primary，带 action）\n\nData model with {path} bindings."},{"id":"msg_003b94206001HzQxRLGLn55l2o","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_WARfklqePGjHIaVYndOQ0399","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"v-form\",\"data\":{\"form\":{\"keyword\":\"\",\"regions\":[],\"includeReturns\":false,\"salesThreshold\":0,\"cutoffDate\":\"2026-08-15T00:00:00\"}},\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"tf-keyword\",\"cp-region\",\"cb-returns\",\"sl-sales\",\"dt-cutoff\",\"btn-apply\"]},{\"component\":\"TextField\",\"id\":\"tf-keyword\",\"label\":\"品类关键词\",\"value\":{\"path\":\"form.keyword\"}},{\"component\":\"ChoicePicker\",\"id\":\"cp-region\",\"label\":\"区域多选\",\"options\":[{\"value\":\"华北\",\"label\":\"华北\"},{\"value\":\"华东\",\"label\":\"华东\"},{\"value\":\"华南\",\"label\":\"华南\"}],\"value\":{\"path\":\"form.regions\"}},{\"component\":\"CheckBox\",\"id\":\"cb-returns\",\"label\":\"包含退货单\",\"value\":{\"path\":\"form.includeReturns\"}},{\"component\":\"Slider\",\"id\":\"sl-sales\",\"label\":\"销售额阈值\",\"min\":0,\"max\":50,\"value\":{\"path\":\"form.salesThreshold\"}},{\"component\":\"DateTimeInput\",\"id\":\"dt-cutoff\",\"label\":\"统计截止日期\",\"enableDate\":true,\"enableTime\":false,\"value\":{\"path\":\"form.cutoffDate\"}},{\"component\":\"Button\",\"id\":\"btn-apply\",\"variant\":\"primary\",\"action\":{\"event\":{\"name\":\"apply-filter\",\"context\":{\"form\":\"{form}\"}}},\"child\":\"btn-label\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"btn-label\",\"text\":\"应用筛选\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_WARfklqePGjHIaVYndOQ0399","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_WARfklqePGjHIaVYndOQ0399","content":"UI surface \"v-form\" rendered (8 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."}]}

